GGL Common Library  ---  Version 1.02 beta
------------------------------------------

22-04-1998

This release of the C common library should be quite stable.
Documentation is still to create. Check the header files...

Compilation
-----------
On Linux, simply type `make dep; make lib; make apps'.
Check the path settings in the Makefile and the configurable
entries in `./config.h'. 

Installation
------------
You probably need to be root
to install the shared libraries for all users.

Just copy the files `include/common.h' and `obj_$PLATFORM/libcommon.a'
to $INSTDIR/include and $INSTDIR/lib respectively, where
$PLATFORM might be i386 or alpha or something like that,
$INSTDIR  could be /usr or /usr/local ...

Non-Linux platforms
-------------------
On other platforms, it is up to you to check the necessary modifications.
Please tell me what you did, and what systems you use, when you get
it running.

Bugs
----

Consult the file BUGS, it might tell you of what we already know.

There probably still are some of them. Please send me a patch, whenever
you find one.

